  "contentPlaintext": "<bold>Changelog</bold>\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file. This project adheres to strict <bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Semantic Versioning</textStyle></bold> rules (<code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code>).\n<bold>1. Table of Contents</bold>\n1. Table of Contents\n2. v1.1.0 — Minor Feature Release\n3. v1.0.1 — Stability Patch\n4. v1.0.0 — Production Baseline Release\n<bold>2. v1.1.0 — Minor Feature Release</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Release Date:</textStyle></bold> May 28, 2026\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Release Tag Variant:</textStyle></bold> <code>v1.1.0</code>\n<bold>2.1 Added Features</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Streaming Ingestion Engine:</textStyle></bold> Integrated an asynchronous streaming chunk parser pipeline to replace legacy full-text memory parsing arrays (<code>RFC-2026-001</code>).\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Hardware Thread Matcher:</textStyle></bold> Added an initialization hook that scales runtime thread pools to match available host CPU processor cores.\n<bold>2.2 Security Changes</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">MFA Authorization Gates:</textStyle></bold> Deployed multi-factor verification checks across all public account access routes.\n<bold>2.3 Bug Remediation</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Memory Leak Fix:</textStyle></bold> Resolved a critical thread accumulation bug that leaked container memory allocations when processing file packages over 20MB.\n<bold>3. v1.0.1 — Stability Patch</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Release Date:</textStyle></bold> April 14, 2026\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Release Tag Variant:</textStyle></bold> <code>v1.0.1</code>\n<bold>3.1 Patched Fixes</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Timeout Latency Patch:</textStyle></bold> Refactored internal gateway socket timeouts to prevent transport connection drops during network drops.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Input Filter Check:</textStyle></bold> Patched database interaction utilities to properly escape alphanumeric string fields, closing minor SQL injection vulnerabilities.\n<bold>4. v1.0.0 — Production Baseline Release</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Release Date:</textStyle></bold> January 10, 2026\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Release Tag Variant:</textStyle></bold> <code>v1.0.0</code>\n<bold>4.1 Production Baseline Capabilities</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Decoupled Architecture Infrastructure:</textStyle></bold> Baselined our three-tier network topology, separating web presentation assets from core application endpoints and data stores.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Persistence Subsystem:</textStyle></bold> Built out production relational storage engines using structured indexing rules.\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Client Onboarding Kits:</textStyle></bold> Published initial documentation bundles, code contribution guidelines, and community codes of conduct.",
  "blocks": []
}